	(text "TCAN3413: 100 nF on VCC (C41) and VIO (C42) (SLLSFS8A 8.4).\nSTB has an internal pull-up (standby): the MCU drives it low to talk.\nTermination R21 + SW1: switch on at the first and last board only (FR38).\nJ7/J8 pin 1 CANH, 2 CANL, 3 CAN GND, 4 spare. R20: CAN ground pin through\n100 Ohm so it never carries chain return current. Transceiver close to J7/J8."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 142.24 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a29af5ff-7a90-486d-b997-5882071832ef")
	)
	(text "USB-C sink only: 5.1k on CC1 / CC2, no PD. USBLC6-2SC6 and C43 1 uF (USB max 10 uF) at the connector.\nThe PC connects only through the isolated USB adapter (FR49)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 261.62 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a15fc4e4-33c9-47b2-922a-ad0975ca6648")
	)
